; The override panel: the owner's hand on what the Flow Nexus holds and
; does, carried on the meta socket as the meta input Override and answered
; Overridden. Each override is recorded in the Flow Nexus's Memory as a
; transition of the flow it acts on, with the cause Overridden.
;
; SetState corrects the state the Nexus holds for a flow. CrystallizeNow
; asks a flow for its crystallization whatever its state; it is Asked, and
; a flow with no harness running is Unharnessed. Renew starts a fresh flow
; of a permaflow from its crystallization and closes the old one; Renewed
; names the fresh flow. Close closes a flow's harness. Deliver hands a
; permaflow its queue now. Unlock releases a permaflow's lock. Forget
; removes the record of a flow that has no harness; a flow with one is
; Harnessed.
;
; Hold is the shutdown switch: the Flow Nexus stops acting on its own, its
; clocks, its deliveries and its launches, and still answers. Resume lets
; it act again.
;
; A flow is Acting while its turn runs, Resting between turns,
; Crystallizing while it writes its crystallization, and Asleep once it has
; no harness.

Signal
[ signal_flow:[ FlowId RefreshRejection ]       ; imports
  flow_ethos:[ Address ] ]
[ SetState.{ FlowId State }                     ; inputs: one override each
  CrystallizeNow.FlowId
  Renew.Address
  Close.FlowId
  Deliver.Address
  Unlock.Address
  Forget.FlowId
  Hold
  Resume ]
[ StateSet.{ FlowId State }                     ; outputs: the n-th answers the n-th input
  Asked.FlowId
  Renewed.FlowId                                ;   the fresh flow
  Closed.FlowId
  Delivered.Address
  Unlocked.Address
  Forgotten.FlowId
  Held
  Resumed
  Refused.[ UnknownFlow.FlowId                  ; a refusal changes nothing
            UnknownAddress.Address
            Harnessed.FlowId                    ;   the flow still has a harness
            Unharnessed.FlowId                  ;   the flow has no harness to ask
            Restarting.FlowId                   ;   a restart holds the flow
            HerdrRefused.FlowId                 ;   Herdr did not close its pane
            Unrenewed.RefreshRejection          ;   the fresh flow did not start, and why
            StoreRefused ] ]
[ State.[ Acting Resting Crystallizing Asleep ] ] ; types: a flow's state
